// Chapter 1, Jay the otter, best friend since second grade.
// Every option runs <<choose "id">>; its effects live in Content/storylets_ch1.json.
// Russian text lives in Story-ru.csv; keep #line ids stable.

title: ch1_friend_intro
---
Someone's banging on your door with a pizza box. It's Jay, the otter you've known since second grade. #line:ch1_friend_intro_01
Jay: You moved and didn't tell me? Cold. Pepperoni or friendship, pick one. Kidding, both. #line:ch1_friend_intro_02
-> Hang out all night like old times. #line:ch1_friend_intro_03
    <<choose "hang_out">>
    You laugh about middle school until three in the morning. Worth it. #line:ch1_friend_intro_04
-> Grab a slice and get back to work. #line:ch1_friend_intro_05
    <<choose "busy">>
    Jay: Workaholic. I'll allow it. For now. #line:ch1_friend_intro_06
===

title: ch1_friend_coin
---
Jay: Okay, hear me out. OtterCoin. It's a coin. For otters. It's up four hundred percent this week. #line:ch1_friend_coin_01
Jay: Put in three hundred. We'll be rich by summer. #line:ch1_friend_coin_02
-> I'm in. #line:ch1_friend_coin_03
    <<choose "invest">>
    Jay: That's my CEO! #line:ch1_friend_coin_04
-> Hard pass. #line:ch1_friend_coin_05
    <<choose "decline">>
    Jay: Your loss, future billionaire. #line:ch1_friend_coin_06
-> Jay, this sounds like a scam. Don't put your rent in it. #line:ch1_friend_coin_07
    <<choose "warn">>
    Jay: Relax, Mom. Okay, maybe I'll only put in half. #line:ch1_friend_coin_08
===

title: ch1_friend_coin_crash
---
OtterCoin is now worth less than the pizza box it was pitched over. The founders deleted their accounts. #line:ch1_friend_coin_crash_01
Jay: I'm so sorry. I really believed it. #line:ch1_friend_coin_crash_02
-> We both got played. Lesson learned. #line:ch1_friend_coin_crash_03
    <<choose "forgive">>
    Jay: Next pizza's on me. For a year. #line:ch1_friend_coin_crash_04
-> You cost me three hundred dollars, Jay. #line:ch1_friend_coin_crash_05
    <<choose "blame">>
    Jay looks at the floor. He doesn't call for a while. #line:ch1_friend_coin_crash_06
===

title: ch1_friend_needs_help
---
Jay: So, the warehouse let me go. Rent's due Friday. I hate asking. #line:ch1_friend_needs_help_01
Jay: Could you spot me two hundred? I'll pay you back, I swear. #line:ch1_friend_needs_help_02
-> Lend him the money. #line:ch1_friend_needs_help_03
    <<choose "lend">>
    Jay: You're the best. Seriously. #line:ch1_friend_needs_help_04
-> Get him a delivery shift instead. #line:ch1_friend_needs_help_05
    <<choose "refer">>
    Jay: Teach a man to fish. Or an otter. Thanks. #line:ch1_friend_needs_help_06
-> Can't right now, sorry. #line:ch1_friend_needs_help_07
    <<choose "refuse">>
    Jay: Yeah. No, I get it. #line:ch1_friend_needs_help_08
===

title: ch1_friend_repays
---
Jay shows up with an envelope and a grin. #line:ch1_friend_repays_01
Jay: Two hundred, plus fifty for being patient. Don't argue. #line:ch1_friend_repays_02
-> Take it. Thanks, Jay. #line:ch1_friend_repays_03
    <<choose "thanks">>
    Friends who pay back are friends for life. #line:ch1_friend_repays_04
===

title: ch1_friend_partner
---
Jay: Real talk. You're good at this. I'm good at talking to people. What if we did resale together? #line:ch1_friend_partner_01
-> Partners. Fifty-fifty on the work, fifty-fifty on the profit. #line:ch1_friend_partner_02
    <<choose "partner">>
    Jay: I'm making business cards. They're going to be terrible. #line:ch1_friend_partner_03
-> I need to stay solo for now. #line:ch1_friend_partner_04
    <<choose "solo">>
    Jay: Respect. Offer's open. #line:ch1_friend_partner_05
===

title: ch1_friend_birthday
---
Jay: It's my birthday. Rooftop, nine o'clock. If you don't come I'll tell everyone about the haircut. #line:ch1_friend_birthday_01
-> Go. It's Jay's birthday. #line:ch1_friend_birthday_02
    <<choose "go">>
    The city glitters below the roof. For one night, nobody talks about money. #line:ch1_friend_birthday_03
-> Skip it for a late shift. #line:ch1_friend_birthday_04
    <<choose "work">>
    You make fifty bucks. Jay posts thirty photos. You're in none of them. #line:ch1_friend_birthday_05
===
